---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>Chill Arcade does not collect any personal information from users. We use third-party ad services (GameDistribution, GameMonetize, and GamePix) that may collect anonymized data for ad targeting and analytics purposes.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Game Platforms</h2>
    <p>Games on this site are provided by three platforms:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>GameDistribution</strong> — Their SDK may collect device information, anonymized usage data, and advertising identifiers</li>
      <li><strong>GameMonetize</strong> — May collect similar anonymized data for ad delivery</li>
      <li><strong>GamePix</strong> — May collect device and usage information for advertising purposes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use minimal cookies for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Dark mode preference storage (localStorage, not a cookie)</li>
      <li>Third-party ad delivery through GameDistribution, GameMonetize, and GamePix</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>Our site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this policy, please contact us via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
